      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, for the writes it is thread safe. However, read operation on the entire trackHolder (handle) object in BtifAvrcpAudioTrackWrite operation doesn\u0027t seem to be thread safe. https://source.corp.google.com/android-internal/packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/btif/src/btif_a2dp_sink.cc;l\u003d527;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0\nSo, there is a possibility of concurrent read occurring during a simultaneous delete operation. I tried adding lock but that was probably causing deadlock. This might be a potential bug. Similarly, there is no lock during the invocation of BtifAvrcpAudioTrackStart (even though the comment mentions to take a lock :) ).",
